ties and esteemed faculty. The university's strong reputation in the fields of biomedical engineering and neuroscience made it the perfect haven for Armin's inquisitive mind. In 2011, Armin Kavehei officially enrolled in Macquarie University's Ph.D.", "original_document_number": 2}], "initial_answers": ["Universidad del Norte", "Macquarie University"]}
